[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
Paseo drives agent CLIs that are installed separately, for example
misc/claude-code, misc/codex, or misc/opencode; log in to each one as the
user that will run Paseo.  To start the daemon at boot:

  sysrc paseo_enable=YES paseo_user=<user>
  service paseo start

or run "paseo daemon start" as that user.  Other settings are in
%%PREFIX%%/etc/rc.d/paseo.

Dictation is off by default: on-device speech needs sherpa-onnx, which is
not available on FreeBSD.  The OpenAI speech provider works instead; see
https://paseo.sh/docs/voice
EOM
}
]
